{"id": "DegJOtMACJg", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "Your Wi-Fi slows down when the microwave is on. You're not imagining it. 📶\n\nMicrowave ovens run at about 2.45 GHz, right on top of Wi-Fi's 2.4 GHz band. The door mesh blocks almost everything, but a tiny leak is enough to drown out your router.\n\nAnd no, 2.45 GHz isn't a magic frequency of water. That's a myth.\n\nIf your router has a 5 GHz network, switch to it. Send this to whoever reheats food during your calls 😤\n\n#wifi #microwave #techexplained #howtechworks #wifitips", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1792072808, "like_count": 11, "comment_count": 0, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18140270560575820a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 62.259, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOqL4cjNFAYbHuC9_5qXeSlBXYaa2eHOeqyVULtUJE8rwMICln8p2IGgO6rXzRt-8bUdA2VzQVq8-2ADqUp5XRf9-qbP8BsBlYCow4.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=AdqwyWFITH-tUVXCUIKpJohJF5R-8wnxRe870uXngDSTdS656S9pTRkXk7oBb7ShdGkMXgGdRvw3oxNlRi4iA6_A&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=NOtgpsg5wmYQ7kNvwEd-Kgy&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=cMW614pJHpRyYg8iHv2NYg&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQRdcuoOJirjJXzwmPxDzw4edjrro0zNBkH-bpddIIW7UA&oe=6AF45696", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 62.259, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "forma